hopfield_gpu_env*/
hopfield-layers/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.vscode/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Datasets (multi-GB, stay on this computer)
#   raw tracking data:   cyto_*/wt_* *_04.csv
#   extracted kinematics: Cyto_/Wt_ "... Kinematics.csv"
# Any CSV in the project root is treated as data.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
/*.csv

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Pipeline outputs (results/ is created by the scripts)
#   kept on GitHub: results/tuning/ (optimal parameters, trial logs)
#                   results/comparisons/ (metrics, report, plots)
#   ignored: large simulated kinematics, caches and run logs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
results/simulations/**/*.csv
results/track_windows/
results/logs/

